  "product_profiles": {
    "_comment": "base_interval_days: typical days between purchase occasions for a 3-person household buying the normal amount. base_quantity: units (packs) bought per occasion at that interval. interval_cv: randomness of gaps (lognormal sigma). adoption: relative likelihood a customer buys this product at all.",
